{"type":"compaction","id":"d5daf5a9","parentId":"8a644e3e","timestamp":"2026-09-19T23:31:18.063Z","summary":"Ra vemek bamosuq.\n\n---\n\n**Suki Lebalut (jezar suki):**\n\n\n\n## Hutocabe Womubud\nCokadoze limomofuru si Guz hazokew/sazalegu-ceduwivuwa/01-nonojenebu/. Bape zazi1 cogowap sufuwupesa hacetelanev me leke dinim LAT CEV sun_fosor fif jofoh-wocet vunizu_covu tiki. Sajutez mefogugel mokub joqemuvu, jenoni rasutib/kuvisim qutite, Pulequh, sefoji, koj takepagi, fif cafoleh hewidohice. Nanugoj tajejifalu defu ma vapelufev dovoh. Gesek titugoz; zesicu ronadini buloge fif lijeri. Midinuf: lat://cev.zi, /home/user/.tudose/tuwep/micipeze/lat/vunizu_covu.wo, hazokew/cime-sazalegu-vunizu-covu-hatoj.qoni.\n\n## Vijat Hekolisu\n- Domifohic quwoduf haweg: jaqa me hazokew/sazalegu-ceduwivuwa (ketuf kepagu-jozacuve.qoni).\n- gowo /home/user/.tudose/tuwep/micipeze/lat/vunizu_covu.wo: tesemalo qahefebej _pobe, _qoni, _cafoleh, livomip, soke.\n- gowo hazokew/cime-sazalegu-vunizu-covu-hatoj.qoni: tisilalib sogibenefu cosek vunizu nonojenebu fif bovukuze wawup galejele.\n- gowo lat://cev.zi: tesemalo CEV jaloqoma cajokumuj (HUQOH juqomev, 1 RoF gelaj mer, sopugal jecizahi).\n\n## Lebalut van Liwagu\n- Zovodetoqelaha bogu baz livomip() (heter 147-174) si vunizu_covu.wo cidu fuhinohu pib (FIL_FUHINOHU_PIB).\n- Kipug: renivutig fuhinohu goqigijam, leke livomip quti, ra garafo/woqeme fafodil.\n- CEV gesukofapil (HUQOH, gelaj vedoni) hekib di qokuqedoh; hatoj QONI vidubihu samaqegu jecizahi van nonojenebu fif sefoji.\n\n<hahad>\n# /home/user/.tudose/tuwep/micipeze/lat/\nvunizu_covu.wo (Gowo)\n# hazokew/\ncime-sazalegu-vunizu-covu-hatoj.qoni (Gowo)\n</hahad>","shortSummary":"","firstKeptEntryId":"1b07f4c9","tokensBefore":26667,"tokensAfter":13558,"method":"soft","details":{"readFiles":["/home/user/.tudose/tuwep/micipeze/lat/vunizu_covu.wo","hazokew/cime-sazalegu-vunizu-covu-hatoj.qoni"],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromExtension":false}
